      "filename": "Irving service-station in the Village historique Acadien from 1936.jpg",
      "title": "File:Irving service-station in the Village historique Acadien from 1936.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/07/Irving_service-station_in_the_Village_historique_Acadien_from_1936.jpg",
